OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'saving #13k a year' after
OL,4,Astopping smoking
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has stopped smoking says
OL,7,Fshe is saving herself #13,000 a year
OL,8,Fwhile looking younger and feeling
OL,9,Fbetter.
OL,11,FNew data from the Office of National
OL,12,FStatistics (ONS) shows the number of
OL,13,Fsmokers in south-west England has
OL,14,Fdropped to the lowest ever recorded
OL,15,Flevel.
OL,17,FRosemary Penn, who lives near Bodmin,
OL,18,Ftook up the habit as a young teen and
OL,19,Fwas smoking 40 to 50 cigarettes a day
OL,20,Funtil March when she decided to stop.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
