OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'saving #13k a year' after
OL,4,Astopping smoking
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 70-year-old said she had made the
OL,7,Fdecision after seeing a sofa for sale:
OL,8,F"I thought, I spent #29.50 a day on
OL,9,Fcigarettes. How long will I have to
OL,10,Fstop smoking before I could afford
OL,11,Fthis? And it was just 26 days."
